OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe death of
OL,4,Afour-month-old baby in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are looking into the death of a
OL,7,Ffour-month-old baby in the north of
OL,8,FGlasgow.
OL,10,FThe death occurred inside a property in
OL,11,FMilton and was reported on Wednesday.
OL,13,FThe BBC contacted the force but it is
OL,14,Fnot yet known whether the circumstances
OL,15,Fare suspicious.
OL,17,FA spokesperson said: "Inquiries are
OL,18,Fongoing to establish the
OL,19,Fcircumstances."
